# Document Validation Enforcement — NON-NEGOTIABLE

**Before presenting ANY generated document to Dee, you MUST run the validator. No exceptions.**

## The Rule

Every document generated in this workspace — email, cap statement, RFQ, quote response, sub outreach — gets validated by `document_validator.py` BEFORE being placed in a SEND_TO folder or presented in chat.

## How to Validate

```python
from document_validator import validate_document, print_validation_report

results = validate_document(
    content=your_generated_content,
    doc_type="buyer_email",  # or cap_statement, supplier_rfq, sub_outreach, quote_response
    known_buyer_names=["Agency Name"],     # for supplier/sub docs
    solicitation_numbers=["W912DR..."],    # for supplier/sub docs
)

print_validation_report(results)
```

Or from terminal:
```bash
python document_validator.py path/to/file.html buyer_email
```

## What It Checks

| Check | Applies To | Severity |
|---|---|---|
| Wrong phone (248.247.5020) | ALL docs | CRITICAL |
| Wrong zip (48083) | ALL docs | CRITICAL |
| Wrong email (bids@deedavisinc.com) | ALL docs | CRITICAL |
| Wrong EIN (47-3015027) | ALL docs | CRITICAL |
| Buyer name leaked | supplier_rfq, sub_outreach | CRITICAL |
| Solicitation number leaked | supplier_rfq, sub_outreach | CRITICAL |
| CO name leaked | supplier_rfq, sub_outreach | CRITICAL |
| Missing CAGE/UEI | buyer_email, cap_statement, quote_response | HIGH |
| Missing EDWOSB | buyer_email, cap_statement, quote_response | HIGH |
| Missing ProposalBio table | buyer_email | HIGH |
| Missing DDI-YYYY-### | supplier_rfq | HIGH |
| Missing signature block | buyer_email | HIGH/MEDIUM |
| Missing diversity section | quote_response | MEDIUM |

## Pass/Fail Rules

- **CRITICAL or HIGH failure = STOP.** Fix before presenting.
- **MEDIUM = warning.** Note it, present anyway.
- **All clear = proceed.**

## When to Run

1. After generating any buyer email
2. After generating any capability statement
3. After generating any supplier RFQ
4. After generating any subcontractor outreach
5. After generating any quote response
6. After ANY edit to an existing document in a SEND_TO folder

## Company Info Source

All company info comes from `company_info.py`. NEVER hardcode company details anywhere. Import from:

```python
from company_info import PHONE_PRIMARY, EMAIL, ADDRESS_ZIP, CAGE_CODE, UEI, SIGNATURE_BLOCK
```

## If Validation Fails

1. Fix every CRITICAL issue immediately
2. Fix every HIGH issue immediately
3. Re-run validation
4. Only present when result is PASS

## Why This Exists

Because rules in .mdc files are passive instructions. This is CODE that catches mistakes before they reach Dee. Wrong phone numbers, leaked buyer names, missing sections — the validator catches what memory misses.